<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT- Fleming upgrades Reuters.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Fleming upgrades Reuters.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts at Robert Fleming on Monday upgraded their recommendation on Reuters Holdings Plc to &quot;trading buy&quot; from &quot;sell&quot;.</p>
<p>Analyst Oliver Ehrenberg noted that since he named the stock one of his &quot;key sells of the year&quot; in January, the shares have fallen 18 percent.  </p>
<p>Ehrenberg added that currency worries had been overdone and gave a share price target of 680p.</p>
<p>The stock was trading 1/2p better at 603p by 0910 GMT.</p>
<p>--Elaine Hardcastle, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
